{{!
    @template local_mailwhistle/draft_campaigns

    Draft campaigns heading, create button, and report table.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * button - HTML for the create-campaign button.
    * table - Rendered report table HTML (already escaped by Report builder).

    Example context (json):
    {
        "button": "<button>Create</button>",
        "table": "<table></table>"
    }
}}

